<title>USA: ONEOK Inc Q3 May 31 net up.</title>
<headline>ONEOK Inc Q3 May 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.49		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net			 13,700		   11,700</p>
<p> Rev			231,627		  289,682</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.32		    $2.15</p>
<p> Net			 64,200		   58,700</p>
<p> Rev			954,031		  992,882</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 results include income from regulated Oklahoma Natural Gas Co of $11.1 million or $0.40 a share vs $8.8 million or $0.31 a share.</p>
<p>Q3 1997 non-regulated income $2.6 million or $0.09 a share vs $2.9 million or $0.11 a share.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1997 results include regulated income of $47.8 million or $1.73 a share vs $47.9 million or $1.75 a share.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1997 non-regulated income $16.4 million or $0.59 a share vs $10.8 million or $0.40 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
